-access milestones.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Senior Delivery Manager team hired and led; owner’s-rep partners contracted and managed.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Delivery standards (schedule, quality, change control, reporting) enforced across the portfolio.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Executive reporting on progress vs plan and regional capacity projections in place.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Competencies&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Senior owner- or GC-side mission-critical delivery leadership.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Builds and leads multi-project teams.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Executive-level developer and GC relationship management.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Leads on site through presence; owns outcomes where no process exists.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Lead. This is a role where leadership trumps management and process. You are expected to be on the region&#39;s sites enough to shape the culture, approach, and aggressiveness that define the extended teams there — across the portfolio, not one project — and to impact outcomes in a favorable manner.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Be a force multiplier. Hire, develop, empower, and lead the Senior Delivery Managers on those sites, and raise the skillset developers, contractors, owner&#39;s-rep partners, and key trades bring to every project in the region; plan resourcing and headcount as the portfolio grows.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Own portfolio execution for the region — schedule, quality, and safety outcomes on every active project, measured against early-floor-access and floor-access milestones. You are empowered and have autonomy to own this regions record of performance.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Drive ownership and influence both inside and outside contractual structures: select, scope, contract, and manage owner&#39;s-rep and project-management partners; where contracts, incentives, or culture get in the way of speed, change them, and replace partners when performance or culture slips&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Set and enforce delivery standards across projects — integrated schedule, quality requirements, change control, reporting, and tools — and validate that they are met&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Identify blockers early and clear them across developer, GC, and trade layers; step in on site where a project needs it&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You may be a good fit if you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Have [10+] years delivering data center or other mission-critical construction, including several as the owner&#39;s or GC&#39;s senior leader on a project campus&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Have led a multi-project portfolio and built the team that delivered it&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Know the end-to-end development process — entitlements and permitting, design, long-lead equipment, construction, commissioning, and handover — well enough to direct partners rather than take their word for it&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Have managed developer, GC, and third-party relationships at the executive level and can move them from arm&#39;s-length contract administration to shared urgency&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Lead through presence: you expect to be on site most of the time and to set the pace and culture of extended teams you don&#39;t directly employ&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Communicate clearly with technical and non-specialist stakeholders and hold a position when challenged&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Are comfortable with ambiguity and with owning outcomes where no process exists yet&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong candidates may also have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Hyperscale data center delivery experience on the owner, developer, or GC side&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Experience with the UK and continental European market — its contractors, permitting regimes, and contractual norms&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Familiarity with lease, construction, and development contract structures and how to align their incentives around speed&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;The annual compensation range for this role is listed below.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
